*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s (200%) spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
