**Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
